text = "Hi! This is the developer, the game is currently a work in progress so i have to add more stuff soon, right now you can exit the game by pressing the X icon or continue to checkout the mechanics by pressing the resume button. If you are a reviewer thanks for making it till here! And if you are just someone who is playing this game thanks for giving this a chance. Cya and you can expect more stuff soon like enemies and boss fights! Sorry since i feel like this game isnt properly built like the idea and all but i will be making this better soon!"
